{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/reel/seed/starchase.html","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-27T19:52:40.263319Z","id":"44f9d6e2feda13c90abbbfed5932a6e4e0aabb789bf70535a254d8c8218720bf","body":{"detail":"frame() skips any animation frame that falls in the same 30th of a second of Date.now() as the last step, so the deterministic camera films the same state however its animation frames were phased (see the concern on web/reel/camera.ts:148:150). In a person's 60 Hz or 120 Hz browser the arena therefore moves at 30 steps a second. It is a seeded page for the reel, not shipped UI.","kind":"waiver","span":{"start":{"line":288},"end":{"line":300},"content_hash":"bac994c3ee51f0cf862a214a6c02725107feece31b8990813f3299a210191d91"},"summary":"The star-chase steps its animation 30 times a second, also in a 60 Hz browser","tags":["session:claude-code:e18aa7d7-bdd7-42c6-a52e-16a9153256f7"]}}
